    <briefdescription>
<para>Protocol constants of ISO 15765-2 and the library result codes. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wire values (frame types, flow status, field limits) are taken from ISO 15765-2 for classical CAN (8 data bytes) with normal addressing. The result codes are library values: the standard defines the N_Result names, not their numbers.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Elements in this group:</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Function return codes: <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1gac21e65efb4680b31bf0e6c6da3150c65" kindref="member">ISOTP_OK</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1ga88c606d0ecf59ce2238ab7a6012e4db3" kindref="member">ISOTP_ERROR</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1ga6c25746e557b248601846c5e38702814" kindref="member">ISOTP_BUSY</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Frame types (N_PCItype) and flow status values. </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Frame layout limits: <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1gad0dc89db63f2e992f564bef3ed180f4c" kindref="member">ISOTP_CAN_DL</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1gab892f980733c79fbd45bd7e07767fca4" kindref="member">ISOTP_SF_MAX_DL</ref>, ... </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>N_Result codes reported by the link: <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1gab7daaebbc303665beb2946ce077d5312" kindref="member">ISOTP_N_OK</ref>, ... </para>
</listitem>
<listitem><para>Big-endian helpers: <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1gab6ceec020b733b5b3118e1670e8e9f91" kindref="member">isotp_get_u32_be</ref>, <ref refid="group__isotp__defs_1ga12a295c719118bce1d276f9b27619dac" kindref="member">isotp_put_u32_be</ref>. </para>
</listitem>
</itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
